</TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">We, Yahoo, Jack Ma and Joe Tsai have granted the underwriters the right to purchase up to an aggregate of
48,015,900 additional ADSs. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Neither the United States Securities and Exchange Commission nor any state securities commission or any other
regulatory body has approved or disapproved of these securities, or determined if this prospectus is truthful or complete. Any representation to the contrary is a criminal offense. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The underwriters expect to deliver the ADSs against payment in U.S. dollars to purchasers on or about September&nbsp;24, 2014. </P>
