<TD WIDTH="1%" VALIGN="top">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top">&#147;ADSs&#148; are to our American depositary shares, each of which represents one ordinary share; </TD></TR></TABLE>
 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P></div></div>

