<IMG SRC="g709111g20m01.jpg" ALT="LOGO">
</P></TD>
<TD VALIGN="bottom"><FONT STYLE="font-size:8pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
<TD VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:2.00em; text-indent:-1.50em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#149;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;We provide a backend hosting system for sellers on our China retail
marketplaces utilizing features including ECS and relational database services (RDS)</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:2.00em; text-indent:-1.50em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#149;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Our
SME loan business utilizes open data processing services (ODPS) to perform credit assessment and risk management of small and micro loan borrowers using transaction data on our retail marketplaces</P>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt; margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt">&nbsp;</P></TD></TR>
