<TD VALIGN="top">Distribution of securities other than ADSs or rights to purchase additional ADSs (i.e., spin-off shares)</TD>
<TD VALIGN="bottom">&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD>
<TD VALIGN="top">Up to US$0.05 per ADS held</TD></TR>
