<TD VALIGN="bottom" NOWRAP> <P STYLE="border-bottom:1.00pt solid #000000; width:19.75pt; font-size:8pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>If we:</B></P></TD>
<TD VALIGN="bottom">&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD>
<TD VALIGN="bottom"> <P STYLE="border-bottom:1.00pt solid #000000; width:20.45pt; font-size:8pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Then:</B></P></TD></TR>


<TR STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">
<TD VALIGN="top">Change the nominal or par value of our ordinary shares</TD>
<TD VALIGN="bottom">&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD>
<TD VALIGN="bottom">The shares received by the depositary will become deposited securities.</TD></TR>
<TR STYLE="font-size:1pt">
