issued and outstanding ordinary shares following the completion of this offering), the applicable lock-up period will terminate one year after the date of this prospectus, except that after 180 days following the date this prospectus, such
individuals may sell or otherwise transfer up to 40% of the ordinary shares owned by them immediately following the completion of this offering (as calculated on a fully-diluted basis); </TD></TR></TABLE>
