of previously held equity interest related to step acquisitions in the consolidated income statements for the years ended March&nbsp;31, 2012, 2013 and 2014, respectively. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">As of March&nbsp;31, 2012,&nbsp;2013 and 2014, the Company assessed the operating and financial targets in connection with previous contingent
consideration arrangements, and revised the fair value of the contingent consideration payable. As a result, the Company recognized a decrease in fair value of contingent consideration of RMB28 million for the year ended March&nbsp;31, 2012, and an
increase in fair value of contingent consideration of RMB13 million and RMB178 million in the consolidated income statements for the years ended March&nbsp;31, 2013 and 2014, respectively. </P>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">F-36 </P>


